title: An assistant that reads three places and edits one leaves a trail of faint marks joined in order, a ring where it read and a dot where it edited
folders: rust-small
limit: 60
expect-log: an assistant \(Codex\) is on the canvas
forbid-log: script: agent needs

wait 3000
fit
wait 1000
agent {"agent":"codex-1","name":"Codex","action":"read","path":"{WORK}/fix/rust-small/src/steps.rs","line":9,"lines":6,"note":"looking for step 3"}
wait 400
agent {"agent":"codex-1","name":"Codex","action":"read","path":"{WORK}/fix/rust-small/src/util.rs","line":1,"lines":3}
wait 400
agent {"agent":"codex-1","name":"Codex","action":"read","path":"{WORK}/fix/rust-small/src/main.rs","line":4,"lines":3}
wait 400
agent {"agent":"codex-1","name":"Codex","action":"edit","path":"{WORK}/fix/rust-small/src/steps.rs","line":37,"lines":3,"note":"step 10"}
wait 1500
mark trail-whole
wait 500
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1500
mark trail-close
wait 500
agent Codex
wait 400
agent {"agent":"codex-1","name":"Codex","action":"read","path":"{WORK}/fix/rust-small/src/util.rs","line":5,"lines":3}
wait 2500
mark following-with-a-trail
wait 500
left settings:where each assistant has been
wait 1500
mark the-setting
wait 500
left settings:close
wait 300
quit
